p-Setup.exe once - your roots,\n  favorites, recents and settings carry over automatically. Linux is unaffected and\n  continues to ship as the AppImage.\n- The installer now asks whether to install for all users (Program Files, the default)\n  or just for you. Self-update keeps whichever scope you installed.\n- Portable copies of the C++ app now self-update in place.\n- The Files / Outline / Edit panel toggles are remembered across runs.\n- Double-clicking a Markdown file in Explorer now brings MD Boss to the front instead\n  of opening the document behind other windows.\n"}
